  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      282.48,
      556.13,
      349.29,
      566.2
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      100.08,
      580.08,
      539.86,
      590.15
    ],
    "text": "1. These regulations may be cited as the Construction Industry (Information Secretariat) Regulations of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      598.08,
      562.28,
      632.15
    ],
    "text": "2. The functions of the information Secretariat established by the Construction Industry Development Authoirty(hereinafter referred to as the ''Authority'') under sub section (1) of section 55 of the Construction Industry Development Act,No. 33 of 2014, shall be as specified in Part I of the Schedule hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      640.08,
      561.62,
      662.15
    ],
    "text": "3.The procedure to be followed by the Information Secretariat in the discharge of its functions shall be as specified inthe Part II of the Schedule hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      670.08,
      561.9,
      692.15
    ],
    "text": "4. The Performance Standards required to be maintained by the Information Secretariat in carrying out its functionsshall be as specified in Part III of the Schedule hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
