      120.48,
      319.66,
      130.55
    ],
    "text": "Part I",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      225.84,
      144.53,
      392.52,
      154.6
    ],
    "text": "Functions of the Information Secretariat",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      62.88,
      168.48,
      272.84,
      178.55
    ],
    "text": "Functions of the Information Secretariat shall be to\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      92.88,
      193.92,
      555.46,
      246.71
    ],
    "text": "(a) maintain a National Data Base in the construction industry;(b) disseminate information on written request made to the Authority;(c) maintain directories of stakeholders of the construction industry; and(d) create links with public sector institutions, universities and other academic institutions that produce professionals",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      110.88,
      250.8,
      178.18,
      260.87
    ],
    "text": "and technocrats.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      297.12,
      287.52,
      321.12,
      297.59
    ],
    "text": "Part II",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      285.12,
      311.57,
      333.21,
      321.64
    ],
    "text": "Procedures",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.88,
      335.52,
      510.47,
      345.59
    ],
    "text": "(a) Data in the following categories for the National Data Base shall be collected through specified formats:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      98.88,
      349.44,
      300.33,
      419.03
    ],
    "text": "(i) construction work awarded;(ii) construction work carrying on and completed;(iii) construction material and components inflow;(iv)labour demand and supply;(v) financial facilities for construction work; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      98.88,
      424.08,
      352.8,
      434.15
    ],
    "text": "(vi)provision of training and development of human resources.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.88,
      449.04,
      555.08,
      459.11
    ],
    "text": "(b) Collected data shall be processed, analyzed and published or interpreted in standard, tabular or graphical formats or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.76,
      461.04,
      197.61,
      471.11
    ],
    "text": "any other required manner.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.88,
      485.04,
      448.98,
      495.11
    ],
    "text": "(c) Disseminate information via emails in soft form, and through postal mail in hard form for\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      98.88,
      503.52,
      289.16,
      527.75
    ],
    "text": "(i) members registered with the Authority; and(ii) subscribers to the information system.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.88,
      542.4,
      555.23,
      552.47
    ],
    "text": "(d) Listing registered stakeholders in directories accessible to subscribers including provision of links to professional",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.76,
      554.4,
      226.91,
      564.47
    ],
    "text": "bodies for linking with directories.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      295.44,
      578.4,
      322.56,
      588.47
    ],
    "text": "Part III",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      255.84,
      602.45,
      362.42,
      612.52
    ],
    "text": "Standards of Performance",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.88,
      626.4,
      334.16,
      636.47
    ],
    "text": "(a) The Authority shall have the copywrite over all its own data.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.88,
      650.4,
      402.34,
      660.47
    ],
    "text": "(b) All data collected from outside shall be with relevant citations and references.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.88,
      674.4,
      477.36,
      684.47
    ],
    "text": "(c) All information provided and data disseminated by the secretariat shall be validated periodically.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      74.88,
      698.4,
      456.27,
      708.47
    ],
    "text": "(d) The secreatriat shall, maintain accurate and complete directories of registered stakeholders.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
